/*!
\page page_sthltbemctowerhit StHltBEmcTowerHit

\brief HLT Barrel Electromagnetic Calorimeter (BEMC) tower hit with geometry, energy, and ADC information.

\section overview Overview

`StHltBEmcTowerHit` stores information for a single BEMC tower hit recorded by the HLT online farm.
The BEMC covers |η| < 1 with 4800 towers and is used in the HLT to identify high-energy electrons
and photons and to match them to charged tracks. An `StHltBEmcTowerHit` is linked to its parent
\ref StHltTrackNode through an `StLink`.

\section hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code
TObject
└── StObject
    └── StHltBEmcTowerHit
\endcode

\section datamembers Data Members

| Type | Name | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| `int` | `mAdc` | Raw ADC count of the tower |
| `float` | `mEnergy` | Calibrated energy deposit (GeV) |
| `float` | `mPhi` | Tower center azimuthal angle (rad) |
| `float` | `mEta` | Tower center pseudorapidity |
| `float` | `mZ` | Tower center z position (cm) |
| `float` | `mSoftId` | Software tower identifier (1–4800) |
| `float` | `mDaqId` | DAQ tower identifier |
| *(StLink)* | `mTrackNode` | Parent track node |

\section keymethods Key Methods

| Signature | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| `int adc() const` | Raw ADC count |
| `float energy() const` | Calibrated tower energy (GeV) |
| `float phi() const` | Tower center φ (rad) |
| `float eta() const` | Tower center η |
| `float z() const` | Tower center z (cm) |
| `float softId() const` | Software tower identifier |
| `float daqId() const` | DAQ tower identifier |
| `StHltTrackNode* trackNode() const` | Parent track node |

\section example Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
const StSPtrVecHltBEmcTowerHit& towers = hlt->bEmcTowerHits();
for (size_t i = 0; i < towers.size(); ++i) {
    cout << "E=" << towers[i]->energy() << " GeV  eta=" << towers[i]->eta() << endl;
}
\endcode

\see StHltEvent
\see StHltTrackNode
*/
